It’s a single-file, inline CSS/JS canvas scene with no external assets or references. I verified it renders cleanly with Playwright at desktop `1440x900` and mobile `390x844`, and confirmed the file has no `src`, `href`, `url()`, `@import`, or HTTP references. The animation also honors `prefers-reduced-motion` by stopping the loop and rendering a static scene.
